# Docker build context for the Api and Worker images (11.1.1-T1): context `.` (docker-compose.yml,
# deploy.yml). Host build output, local runtime state and secrets must never enter the context —
# `COPY src/` would otherwise overwrite the assets the in-container `dotnet restore` just produced,
# and publish --no-restore would then use the host's NuGet paths.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules

# Local runtime state and secrets (git-ignored, tools/dev/up.sh writes them).
.nts
.env
.env.*

# Repository metadata and local-only inputs the images never copy.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.githooks
.github
TestResults
trial
docs
plans
prompts
infra
worker-node
